==Battleground==
*3 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*3 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Festive Otter]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
**5 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
**3 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
An easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

